WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:02.280
- Part of the idea of believing

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:05.150
that what happens to other
black people affects you

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.920
and recognizing that you're
not just an individual,

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:11.480
but that politically because
of the social marker of race,

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:13.020
and social stigma of race,

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:15.230
that your identity is salient

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:17.580
and that it makes sense
for people to join together

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.970
to try to collectively
improve their community

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:22.660
and their group status
within the community.

00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:25.390
That also creates
opportunities for healing,

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:28.000
because you don't have
to suffer this alone.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.240
Other people saw the exact
same thing that you do

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.280
that you did.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:33.880
And if you talk about it right there

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:35.690
that's a way to help work through

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:38.211
some of that trauma together.

00:00:38.211 --> 00:00:40.794
(upbeat music)

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.790
- Welcome to the first
episode of the Addy Hour.

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:48.840
I'm really excited to get
this program off the ground

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.861
and really thrilled to introduce
you to some great guests

00:00:50.861 --> 00:00:53.330
as we talk through some really important

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:55.560
and some really deep content at times.

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:57.960
So just before we jump
into this first episode

00:00:57.960 --> 00:00:59.500
I do wanna set the stage just a little bit

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:00.940
and to say that one of the things

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:03.680
that I'm really trying
to do on this podcast

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:05.480
is to pair unique individuals

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:08.300
from really different walks
of life who can come and share

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:11.480
on the same topic and share
from their unique perspectives

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:13.010
