00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:14.740
and from their what they're
going to experience.

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:16.410
So I think there's gonna
be a lot of great content

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:17.910
that we're gonna be able
to talk through together.

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:20.000
And I'm happy to be able
to bring that to you

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.430
through the series.

00:01:21.430 --> 00:01:23.670
And with that, I'm
really excited to welcome

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:25.700
the first two guests on the program,

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:27.835
Dr. Jeff Gardere and Dr. Andra Gillespie.

00:01:27.835 --> 00:01:31.053
So, welcome to both of you.

00:01:31.053 --> 00:01:31.902
- Thank you.

00:01:31.902 --> 00:01:33.397
- Thank you.

