days with everything?

00:04:24.066 --> 00:04:26.340
- I think I'm struggling managing

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:28.183
the same way that everybody else is.

00:04:29.982 --> 00:04:31.610
My quarantine experience in part

00:04:31.610 --> 00:04:34.230
because of the racial tension

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:37.180
and because I study
campaigns and elections means

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:40.810
that my work increased over the last year.

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:42.960
And so that's certainly
a challenge to try to

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:44.560
balance it out,

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:45.630
staying at home sometimes

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:46.730
makes it a little bit easier

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:48.550
