00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:54.640
and what balance actually looks like

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:57.130
both during quarantine
and after quarantine.

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:58.915
And so I can't say that
I've perfected it though,

00:04:58.915 --> 00:05:01.235
I've certainly learned a lot about myself

00:05:01.235 --> 00:05:03.850
and learned a lot about what my limits are

00:05:03.850 --> 00:05:06.130
and revisiting what my post COVID limits

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:08.320
and balance is going
to look like as I still

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:11.050
