00:05:43.195 --> 00:05:47.060
- Well, it's certainly
I can cry salty tears

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:48.940
as to what has happened politically.

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:50.840
And I know you'll be getting into that

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:55.200
to America and certainly how

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.310
the virus has been mismanaged

00:05:59.478 --> 00:06:01.770
in the past year or so

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:03.910
seems like it's been forever certainly.

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:05.520
And we have a lot of high hopes

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:07.960
with the Biden administration to fix that.

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:11.177
And it looks like it is moving
forward on the right track.

00:06:11.177 --> 00:06:13.650
But along with that,

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:15.870
and mourning the people who have died

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:19.300
and gotten sick and
certainly opened our eyes

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:22.230
to all of the political changes,

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:23.720
financial changes

00:06:26.024 --> 00:06:28.010
sociological changes in the world

00:06:29.158 --> 00:06:31.300
including the global warming and so on.

00:06:31.300 --> 00:06:34.240
And, and just really watching that

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:38.190
in a way where I go to bed every night

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:39.650
with my mouth open.

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:42.130
I wake up every morning
with my mouth open.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:45.640
I cannot believe what has
happened to our world.

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:47.290
At the same time,

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:49.507
it's also been a very strange

00:06:49.507 --> 00:06:54.507
and beautiful existence being
in the house every single day.

00:06:56.145 --> 00:06:56.978
I'm virtually in exile.

00:06:56.978 --> 00:07:00.540
And I've chosen that a particular life

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:03.450
I've taken joy and pleasure in it.

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:04.970
Seeing my family every day,

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:06.680
seeing my children every day.

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:08.430
As a matter of fact,

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:10.390
I saw the kids a couple of
weeks ago in the kitchen,

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:12.910
and I had to ask my
wife who are those kids?

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:14.350
She was like, those are your kids.

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:15.183
I was like, wow.

00:07:15.183 --> 00:07:17.840
Finally, I get to recognize
and spend time with them.

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:20.540
And I know Dr. Gillespie
perhaps goes through that too

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:23.100
but it certainly was

00:07:24.289 --> 00:07:27.240
being home every day has

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:29.770
given me the time to pause and think

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:32.680
about what life is about and what it is

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:36.480
that I need to do once we
go back out into the world.

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:38.100
But I have to say this,

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:40.473
and I'll keep quiet after this.

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:44.350
If I never had to leave this house

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:45.680
or this property that I'm in

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:47.540
and you could see a little bit of it,

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:48.450
from my window.

00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:51.100
If I never had to leave again,

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:53.220
I think I would just stay here

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:55.630
and work for the rest of my life.

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:58.718
And I'm a guy who's a Manhattan
Knight and all of that

00:07:58.718 --> 00:08:02.510
but it certainly has changed things for me

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:05.289
in a very dramatic way as
it has for everyone else.

00:08:05.289 --> 00:08:06.122
- Yeah.

00:08:06.122 --> 00:08:06.955
I think that's very well said.

00:08:06.955 --> 00:08:08.520
And I mean, so many important components

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:10.030
